---
title: Pay — Things 4 Good
description: Send your Things 4 Good candle donation by Venmo, Cash App, Zelle or Apple Pay, or bring cash or a check. 100% goes to good.
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}

{# The link Jamie sends buyers to settle up: things4good.xyz/pay/ (or /pay/#venmo and the other card ids). Same cards as /preorder/#payment. #}

{% block content %}

<section class="section page-head" id="head">
  <div class="hero-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="back-link" href="/">&larr; Things 4 Good</a>
    <p class="eyebrow">How to pay</p>
    <h1 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(2.4rem,5.4vw,4rem);letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.02;max-width:18ch">Send your donation.</h1>
    <p class="lead" style="margin-top:18px">Each candle is a <b style="color:var(--ink)">${{ site.pricePerCandle }} donation</b>. Pick whichever way is easiest. On a phone, tap a button to open the app. On a computer, scan a code with your phone.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="payment" style="padding-top:clamp(20px,3vw,32px)">
  <div class="wrap">
    {% include "payment-methods.njk" %}

    <div class="good-note reveal" style="margin-top:clamp(28px,4vw,40px)">
      <span class="hand" style="font-size:1.7rem">100% &mdash; for real.</span>
      <span style="font-weight:500;color:var(--pine-d)">We pay for the materials ourselves, so everything you send becomes a donation. Preorders are divided evenly across this year&rsquo;s four causes. At the sale, add a note to choose your own split.</span>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:22px;color:var(--ink-soft)">Questions? Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" style="color:var(--marigold-d);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

{% endblock %}
